  <title>Draft purchase orders</title>

  <p>The <gui>Draft POs</gui> button of the main window lists every open
  <link xref="purchase_order">purchase order</link> with at least one line,
  one per vendor.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>Double click an order, or select it and click <gui>Open PO in
    purchase order window</gui>, to work on it. Check <gui>Hide when opening
    purchase order</gui> to have this window step out of the way when you
    do.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click an order's <gui>Purchase Order name</gui> to rename it. An
    order open in another window cannot be renamed until it is
    closed.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>New PO</gui> opens a blank purchase order.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
